From: Majid Arasskhani <M.Arasskhani@gosilkroad.net>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 17:37:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 18/22] chore(review): small corrections found in the phase 0-2
 self-review

- main.py logs "This worker is now the scheduler leader" for the
  synchronous first acquire too (the operator instruction to look for that
  line only matched the background-loop path; with N workers exactly one
  acquires synchronously and nothing was logged).
- SAML rejection audit rows use resolve_client_ip (behind the edge proxy
  request.client.host is always the proxy).
- Connection base_url SSRF check runs DNS resolution in a thread.
- user_media_cleanup_due builds the (hour, minute) slot in the server
  timezone and converts back to UTC before comparing with last_cleanup_at;
  the compare used to mix a UTC clock with a wall-clock setting.
- CI scripts-tests runs on debian:bookworm-slim (GNU sed/grep/date like the
  Ubuntu hosts) instead of busybox bash:5.
- Import placement: anyio with third-party imports in proxy_service,
  development_origins at the top of main.py, asyncio at the top of admin.py.

